  "description": "It is proposed to Construct an additional storey to the principal part of the existing two-storey dwellinghouse of 55 Ornan Road, London, NW3 4QD in line with the conditions set out within Schedule 2, Part 1, Class AA of the General Permitted Order 2015 (as amended). The additional storey would accommodate a further three bedrooms and a bathroom. In line with the requirements, no windows will be located on the side elevations of the additional storey. Additional windows will be located in the front and rear elevations in order to provide the new rooms with good level of light. The new windows will be the same size and style as the existing windows. \n\nPlease see cover letter and plans for further information.",
